WEBVTT

00:06.150 --> 00:08.090
<i>Betraying little witch...</i>

00:08.370 --> 00:09.300
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:09.860 --> 00:14.950
<i>That's a perfect name for me.</i>

01:47.250 --> 01:53.000
<b>#2 "The Princess's Confession"</b>

01:47.480 --> 01:50.670
I mean, the Koiwais, 
the servants of the Adagaki family,

01:50.670 --> 01:53.120
are pretty famous for that.

01:53.120 --> 01:57.800
Wouldn't this be going against 
your master's wishes?

01:57.800 --> 02:00.720
I'm Adagaki Aki's fiancé.

02:01.020 --> 02:04.570
You're ignoring your master and secretly 
meeting with Makabe Masamune.

02:04.570 --> 02:07.930
I wonder what they'd say if 
they ever found out about that.

02:08.390 --> 02:09.730
Sure, why not?

02:10.640 --> 02:12.660
If you want to snitch on me, go ahead.

02:14.250 --> 02:17.850
Wow... I guess that didn't hurt at all.

02:17.850 --> 02:19.340
Unfortunately, no.

02:20.780 --> 02:24.410
Oh, by the way, when I said "them," 
I didn't mean Aki-chan.

02:24.410 --> 02:26.870
I was talking about your parents.

02:28.300 --> 02:31.950
I mean, honestly, your feelings 
are pretty understandable.

02:31.950 --> 02:34.040
Because you're like me.

02:34.040 --> 02:34.880
You...

02:35.620 --> 02:38.450
Aki-chan's pretty pure, too.

02:38.450 --> 02:41.550
I'm pretty sure I'll have no 
problem winning her over.

02:42.800 --> 02:46.640
But if the families get involved, 
things will be different.

02:46.640 --> 02:49.520
You can't break away from 
the status you were born into.

02:49.840 --> 02:51.190
Not even a step.

02:53.330 --> 02:56.980
I mean, if you could, 
you wouldn't come all the way to Paris

02:56.980 --> 03:00.410
dealing with this warped 
master-servant relationship.

03:02.440 --> 03:04.160
Don't speak as if you know me.

03:04.710 --> 03:08.810
I'm only doing what I'm doing 
because you're unworthy of Aki-sama.

03:08.810 --> 03:11.800
I've thought that ever since you 
appeared at the Adagaki home.

03:11.800 --> 03:13.610
You're so conniving.

03:13.610 --> 03:16.140
Oh? And how am I conniving, exactly?

03:16.140 --> 03:19.420
I very much plan on bringing 
some grandchildren into the world.

03:19.420 --> 03:20.670
That's not what I'm talking about!

03:20.670 --> 03:23.520
You're acting like someone who's 
precious to Aki-sama and lyi—

03:32.480 --> 03:33.860
Are you going to say it?

03:35.250 --> 03:38.480
Don't blame me if they 
find out about that thing.

03:43.950 --> 03:44.970
See?

03:44.970 --> 03:49.330
You saying those things just because you 
don't like me really won't get through to me.

03:49.690 --> 03:52.960
But anyway, your parents are pissed.

03:52.960 --> 03:56.750
They're wondering what you're doing, 
skipping out on work like this.

03:56.750 --> 03:59.300
You should probably lay low for a while

03:59.600 --> 04:03.020
so they don't relieve you 
of your attendant duties.

04:23.370 --> 04:25.360
<i>Show how it's done?</i>

04:25.360 --> 04:27.220
<i>How are we supposed to do that?</i>

04:31.080 --> 04:35.610
<i>C-Calm down, me! How lame 
would I be if I lost my cool here?</i>

04:35.610 --> 04:38.830
<i>In the end, this is just part
 of the Dead or Love plan.</i>

04:38.830 --> 04:41.690
<i>I just need to take the lead!</i>

04:44.590 --> 04:45.680
Hey—

04:49.160 --> 04:50.760
Let's go for a little walk.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.980
Right...

04:58.940 --> 05:04.000
I see. It seems like they're really going for it.

05:04.000 --> 05:07.820
It's very clear that you're working hard to 
lessen the distance between you two, it is.

05:07.820 --> 05:10.370
<i>This French girl doesn't hold back!</i>

05:16.760 --> 05:18.640
What a beautiful city...

05:18.640 --> 05:19.750
<i>Next...</i>

05:20.370 --> 05:21.740
Why, yes...

05:21.740 --> 05:23.210
<i>What do we do next?</i>

05:31.240 --> 05:34.750
I never thought I'd be walking 
side by side with you like this.

05:35.670 --> 05:36.820
Me, neither.

05:43.940 --> 05:46.700
Next, let's wander around Akiba.

05:46.700 --> 05:49.990
There will be anime, games, 
and manga waiting for us there!

05:50.840 --> 05:54.680
When I'm with you, I could walk 
to the end of the Mansei Bridge!

05:56.460 --> 05:59.150
Could you stop awkwardly dubbing over us?

05:59.150 --> 06:01.920
Aw, but I thought it was a good idea, I did.

06:01.920 --> 06:05.420
You can let your creativity run free after 
you get the basic shape of this drama down.

06:09.160 --> 06:10.840
<i>My hand is sweating so much!</i>

06:10.840 --> 06:14.760
<i>Crap, crap, crap. 
Did she notice I'm actually nervous?</i>

06:16.240 --> 06:19.880
<i>Huh? The one that wasn't 
holding her hand is fine?</i>

06:21.160 --> 06:22.800
Listen carefully, Muriel.

06:22.800 --> 06:26.460
Stop butting in. Take a few more steps back.

06:26.460 --> 06:28.860
A-All right, then...

06:29.940 --> 06:33.640
<i>I guess the Cruel Princess is 
doing the best she can, too...</i>

06:35.990 --> 06:37.510
Honestly...

06:38.180 --> 06:39.530
Let's continue this already.

06:39.530 --> 06:40.600
Okay...

06:44.200 --> 06:45.710
<i>I see...</i>

06:46.770 --> 06:48.220
<i>I get it!</i>

06:53.140 --> 06:55.580
Huh? Wh-What is it?

06:56.110 --> 06:58.700
You're shameless, you stupid Makabe!

06:58.700 --> 07:00.600
Oh, are you out of gas?

07:00.600 --> 07:03.520
I want to end myself...

07:03.520 --> 07:06.140
Er, it's not <i>that</i> big of a deal...

07:06.630 --> 07:09.240
Anyway, why don't we go get something to eat?

07:09.720 --> 07:10.840
Together.

07:13.200 --> 07:17.230
Food. Energy. Sugar. Carbohydrates.

07:17.230 --> 07:19.540
<i>Well, she's not saying no.</i>

07:27.200 --> 07:28.970
Took you long enough, Makabe!

07:28.970 --> 07:32.570
Sorry. You're okay with mustard 
on your sandwich, ri—

07:37.920 --> 07:41.390
Hey... You think we should
just eat these like usual?

07:41.390 --> 07:42.350
What?!

07:42.620 --> 07:46.260
I mean... Muriel's staring really hard.

07:50.450 --> 07:51.990
Right...

07:53.000 --> 07:56.800
Maybe we should do something rom-com-like.

07:56.800 --> 07:58.440
She did say to show her how it's done.

07:58.440 --> 08:00.790
But what are we supposed to do?

08:01.650 --> 08:04.210
Maybe we should feed each other.

08:07.320 --> 08:09.180
Wait, I don't have ulterior motives!

08:09.180 --> 08:10.730
If you have any other ideas...

08:10.730 --> 08:13.220
No, I don't! I don't have any at all!

08:13.220 --> 08:15.720
Then, uh, let's go with the feeding thing.

08:15.720 --> 08:18.220
Yes, yes! That's a great idea!

08:22.810 --> 08:26.440
Here... Open wide, Makabe-kun...

08:26.440 --> 08:30.150
H-How nice of you... Adagaki-san...

08:33.680 --> 08:35.450
<i>I-It's so hard to eat...</i>

08:40.520 --> 08:42.700
Th-Thanks for the food...

08:52.090 --> 08:55.340
I don't have time for this shit!

08:56.450 --> 08:57.550
Oh?

08:57.550 --> 09:01.420
I can't... Why the hell do I have to do this?!

09:01.420 --> 09:04.890
I'd rather eat it myself than feed it to him!

09:07.520 --> 09:11.580
<i>Sorry, Muriel, but this is our limit.</i>

09:22.070 --> 09:25.830
Nope. I can't give you this.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.590
Jeanne!

09:32.130 --> 09:34.740
Toutes mes excusez, mademoiselle.

09:32.500 --> 09:33.960
Excusez moi!

09:39.430 --> 09:40.830
You always did like them.

09:40.830 --> 09:41.430
Huh?

09:41.920 --> 09:43.680
Dogs, especially big ones.

09:43.680 --> 09:47.400
Did I ever mention that before? 
We used to have big dogs, but...

09:47.400 --> 09:49.660
Used to? What about now?

09:49.660 --> 09:53.290
I haven't had any since we lost our last one.

09:53.290 --> 09:56.410
I couldn't bring myself to get a new one.

09:57.520 --> 10:02.510
<i>I see... So those were the last ones.</i>

10:06.350 --> 10:09.580
This is the perfect opportunity, 
so will you just listen for a bit?

10:11.360 --> 10:16.080
Before, I wasn't a big eater or anything.

10:16.080 --> 10:18.510
How I ended up like this...

10:19.080 --> 10:23.470
and why I can't accept your feelings...

10:24.900 --> 10:27.940
I'll tell you everything now.

10:31.440 --> 10:33.440
You mustn't, Aki-sama.

10:33.790 --> 10:35.640
I can't see her?

10:36.110 --> 10:38.970
We don't want you getting chickenpox, too.

10:38.970 --> 10:40.820
Well, that's boring.

10:41.480 --> 10:45.390
I wanted to have fun playing
with makeup with Yoshino again.

10:45.390 --> 10:47.290
Are you really blaming all this on me?!

10:47.290 --> 10:48.960
You always do this!

10:48.960 --> 10:50.580
Just shut up! I've had enough of you!

10:50.580 --> 10:52.240
You always run away like that!

10:52.240 --> 10:55.900
You're always so selfish! 
Just think for a damn second!

10:55.900 --> 10:58.840
I'm the one who's had enough...

10:56.170 --> 10:58.840
Why did I ever get married 
to someone like you?

10:59.460 --> 11:02.300
Sean! Lancelot! Come here!

11:02.850 --> 11:06.010
Oh, hey! That tickles!

11:07.240 --> 11:09.750
I guess you're my only friends today.

11:10.280 --> 11:12.580
No, that's plenty.

11:13.970 --> 11:14.980
Sean?

11:15.370 --> 11:17.130
You can't get away now.

11:17.130 --> 11:18.690
You put us through too much trouble!

11:18.690 --> 11:22.440
M-My family's really rich!

11:22.440 --> 11:26.160
You moron. Then treat us to something.

11:26.430 --> 11:28.550
Sean, get them!

11:31.320 --> 11:34.250
What do you think you're doing 
in front of my house?

11:34.250 --> 11:35.100
Uh-oh!

11:35.100 --> 11:36.390
Let's go!

11:41.640 --> 11:42.820
What's your name?

11:44.380 --> 11:46.320
I'm asking you for your name.

11:46.320 --> 11:50.200
I-I'm... Masamune.

11:50.200 --> 11:53.520
You look awful. Wipe off your face.

11:54.360 --> 11:56.250
Fank you...

11:57.800 --> 11:59.960
Who blows their nose at a time like this?!

11:59.960 --> 12:02.310
Huh? Should I not have?

12:02.310 --> 12:05.390
S-Sorry... I'll wash it and return it to you.

12:05.390 --> 12:06.950
I don't want it anymore.

12:08.480 --> 12:10.660
It's fine! Stop crying!

12:11.960 --> 12:15.020
<i>That was how Masamune and I met.</i>

12:16.030 --> 12:18.590
There you are, Aki.

12:18.590 --> 12:22.800
<b>Snow White</b>

12:19.040 --> 12:21.680
Want to go to dinner with me?

12:21.680 --> 12:22.800
Just the two of us?

12:22.800 --> 12:25.140
Yes, it'll be a little date.

12:25.260 --> 12:28.390
No. Don't wear that outfit.

12:28.390 --> 12:30.040
Really?

12:30.040 --> 12:32.700
Let's go have some clothes made for you.

12:32.700 --> 12:35.530
There's a designer 
I always request outfits from.

12:35.530 --> 12:36.750
Just the two of us?

12:36.750 --> 12:37.820
Yes.

12:38.420 --> 12:41.360
<i>I guess all three of us going isn't an option...</i>

12:42.040 --> 12:45.290
<i>So whoever gets my affection wins?</i>

12:46.600 --> 12:49.280
Aki-chan, this is to thank 
you for the other day.

12:49.280 --> 12:51.660
Chocolate from Patisserie Otafuku.

12:51.660 --> 12:56.060
They only make ten of these a day! 
Isn't that amazing?

12:56.470 --> 12:58.830
I'm honestly tired of stuff like this.

12:58.830 --> 13:00.630
Huh?! But why?

13:01.080 --> 13:03.440
My mom and dad aren't getting along.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.660
They only start fighting about

13:05.660 --> 13:09.120
how much presents cost or how rare 
they are when they want to win my favor.

13:09.120 --> 13:12.980
It's so lame. I'm just sick of it.

13:12.980 --> 13:15.100
O-Oh, no...

13:16.480 --> 13:21.240
You don't need to cry. 
You can eat them if you want.

13:21.240 --> 13:25.400
B-But I feel so bad for you, Aki-chan...

13:26.980 --> 13:32.300
I would be really sad if my mom 
and dad didn't get along...

13:33.370 --> 13:36.150
I wouldn't want that!

13:37.160 --> 13:38.830
You're so nice...

13:39.330 --> 13:40.760
Masamune.

13:44.160 --> 13:45.550
A-Ahi-hyan?!

13:45.550 --> 13:49.930
But you're too weak. 
You need to toughen up a bit.

13:50.650 --> 13:55.200
Masamune, I'll train you so you 
won't lose to those bullies anymore.

13:55.200 --> 13:56.320
Huh?

13:56.320 --> 13:57.580
Lancelot!

14:02.970 --> 14:05.400
Save me!

14:06.630 --> 14:10.860
<i>I don't remember the last 
time I laughed this much.</i>

14:11.770 --> 14:14.580
Okay, look this way.

14:18.680 --> 14:20.540
Lancelot, sit.

14:20.890 --> 14:22.500
Okay, now you try.

14:23.940 --> 14:27.800
G-Good boy... Good boy...

14:34.530 --> 14:35.320
See?

14:36.480 --> 14:40.590
<i>With my guidance, Masamune 
grew a little stronger every day...</i>

14:40.590 --> 14:43.160
<i>and every day became fun for me.</i>

14:45.110 --> 14:46.090
But...

14:48.050 --> 14:50.160
Where are you, Tubbymune?!

14:50.160 --> 14:53.120
You've got some nerve bailing 
after you called us out here!

14:50.160 --> 14:53.120
<b></b>Come to the park
tomorrow at 5 PM.
-Masamune

14:53.440 --> 14:55.370
I'm right here.

14:55.760 --> 14:58.330
Hey, what are you doing up there?

14:58.670 --> 15:01.100
I'm sick and tired of everything.

15:02.290 --> 15:06.120
Today's the last day you'll ever bully me.

15:06.560 --> 15:07.760
I've also left a will.

15:08.360 --> 15:11.780
Everything you've done 
to me will come to light.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.680
Goodbye, you embarrassments.

15:15.680 --> 15:16.800
H-Hey!

15:16.800 --> 15:17.860
Crap!

15:20.250 --> 15:21.550
What is this?

15:21.550 --> 15:22.850
You tricked us!

15:22.850 --> 15:24.880
Ow! Dang it!

15:24.800 --> 15:26.580
That was a huge success.

15:24.880 --> 15:26.950
Who do you think you are?!

15:27.620 --> 15:29.780
You finish them off.

15:28.660 --> 15:30.800
Man, that hurt!

15:30.800 --> 15:31.820
Okay.

15:32.820 --> 15:36.410
I'm not scared of you guys anymore.

15:40.840 --> 15:43.530
They should stop bothering you now.

15:43.530 --> 15:46.040
It's all thanks to you, Aki-chan.

15:46.040 --> 15:49.200
I never would've been able 
to do this on my own.

15:49.200 --> 15:51.260
I just helped you out a little bit.

15:52.130 --> 15:56.870
I want you, at least, to be happy.

15:57.370 --> 15:58.430
Huh?

15:58.810 --> 16:00.500
It's hopeless for me.

16:01.110 --> 16:04.400
My parents are separating.

16:05.360 --> 16:06.480
Aki-chan...

16:06.480 --> 16:10.360
H-Huh? That's weird.

16:17.380 --> 16:19.680
This time, it's my turn.

16:19.680 --> 16:23.140
I'm going to keep supporting you 
so you can cheer up.

16:23.880 --> 16:25.300
I'll stay by your side!

16:30.130 --> 16:32.460
So... what happened after that?

16:33.140 --> 16:37.760
Nothing. He never showed his face again.

16:37.760 --> 16:38.760
Huh?!

16:39.220 --> 16:43.220
I guess he just wanted someone 
to save him from the bullies.

16:43.740 --> 16:47.110
I just ended up having feelings for him.

16:47.520 --> 16:50.680
But... I really did like him.

16:50.680 --> 16:54.320
His puffy cheeks, 
his tubby tummy... everything.

16:54.960 --> 16:56.920
Ever since I cried and started binge eating,

16:56.920 --> 16:59.420
I just couldn't stop overeating, 
and I'm tired of it.

17:00.450 --> 17:04.350
And I guess Masamune didn't feel 
bad about disappearing, either.

17:04.350 --> 17:06.840
H-How do you know?

17:06.840 --> 17:09.370
Well, he told me himself.

17:09.370 --> 17:10.090
Huh?

17:10.430 --> 17:12.170
Gasou Kanetsugu...

17:12.570 --> 17:15.320
He used to be kind like that 
when we were younger, too.

17:15.320 --> 17:17.300
Masamune is his old nickname.

17:17.300 --> 17:21.230
<i>The Cruel Princess thinks Gasou is me?</i>

17:21.230 --> 17:23.280
<i>Wait, before that...</i>

17:23.770 --> 17:26.730
<i>Everything she said is completely 
different from my memories.</i>

17:27.080 --> 17:31.940
I don't ever want to feel that sad again.

17:32.280 --> 17:38.910
So... that's why I can't accept 
your feelings toward me.

17:40.160 --> 17:42.120
<i>What is she talking about?</i>

17:42.560 --> 17:44.080
<i>Feel sad?</i>

17:44.080 --> 17:47.930
<i>You're the one who chased me away, saying 
you could never have feelings for me!</i>

17:47.930 --> 17:49.080
<i>You called me Pig's Foot!</i>

17:50.120 --> 17:52.650
<i>That's why... I...</i>

17:53.050 --> 17:54.510
There!

17:58.980 --> 18:04.430
Aki-chan was crying... 
I hope this cheers her up a little.

18:05.170 --> 18:06.890
Hey, Tubbymune!

18:06.890 --> 18:09.520
We need to thank you for the other day.

18:11.660 --> 18:12.920
Hey, wait!

18:14.280 --> 18:18.220
<i>Almost... I'm almost at Aki-chan's house...</i>

18:24.550 --> 18:26.030
Aki-chan!

18:26.030 --> 18:27.370
Hold it!

18:27.950 --> 18:29.520
What the hell's this?

18:29.520 --> 18:30.890
Give it back!

18:31.400 --> 18:33.050
They're filthy!

18:36.930 --> 18:39.510
Aki-chan! Aki-chan!

18:39.510 --> 18:43.690
This loser's trying to get that 
boss girl to save him again?

18:43.690 --> 18:45.290
Talk about pathetic!

18:45.290 --> 18:48.020
No! Aki-chan's not like that!

18:48.020 --> 18:50.360
I promised her I'd stay by her side!

18:50.360 --> 18:52.700
We're going to be friends forever and—

18:52.700 --> 18:54.690
Shut up, you stupid boys.

18:58.760 --> 18:59.520
Aki-cha—

18:59.520 --> 19:01.870
I'll never fall in love with you,

19:02.520 --> 19:03.820
Pig's Foot.

19:04.330 --> 19:05.850
Talk about sad!

19:05.850 --> 19:07.430
He just got shot down!

19:08.690 --> 19:10.290
She called him Pig's Foot!

19:11.040 --> 19:12.420
Aki-chan...

19:13.730 --> 19:16.060
<i>The Dead or Love plan...</i>

19:16.060 --> 19:18.210
<i>Making her fall for me, then dumping her.</i>

19:18.210 --> 19:21.000
<i>Adagaki Aki actually did the 
exact same thing to me first!</i>

19:21.530 --> 19:25.610
<i>So how is she able to look 
like the tragic heroine here?!</i>

19:27.560 --> 19:29.050
You can't be serious.

19:29.710 --> 19:32.630
Then why did you call me 
"Pig's Foot" and chase me away?

19:32.990 --> 19:34.110
What are you talking about?

19:34.110 --> 19:35.320
Quit acting like the victim!

19:35.320 --> 19:37.280
You deserved everything you got!

19:40.740 --> 19:43.950
Non! What is the meaning of this?

19:44.770 --> 19:47.610
Fighting is bad, it is!

19:50.000 --> 19:51.160
This is just too cruel.

19:52.150 --> 19:55.040
I thought you'd at least hear me out.

20:01.760 --> 20:06.410
Masamune! Aki left! Aren't you 
going to chase after her?

20:08.160 --> 20:09.310
Sorry...

20:10.520 --> 20:12.860
But I can't think about anything right now.

20:15.940 --> 20:20.910
Money is important! Money is important!

20:29.450 --> 20:32.540
What's the matter, Aki-chan? 
What happened?

20:32.830 --> 20:35.890
I'd be happy to listen, Ak—

20:39.030 --> 20:41.170
What the heck happened?

20:50.900 --> 20:52.360
What is it, Nii-san?

20:52.360 --> 20:54.980
<i>Where the hell are those 
stupid Japanese kids?!</i>

20:55.320 --> 20:58.980
<i>I thought they were supposed to 
teach you the essence of rom-coms!</i>

21:00.720 --> 21:03.720
We ran into a bit of trouble, 
so it's been canceled.

21:03.720 --> 21:05.660
<i>I'll talk to them again and make them—</i>

21:05.660 --> 21:08.090
If you do that, I'll hate you!

21:09.520 --> 21:13.410
Nii-san, I'm going to draw a new manga.

21:14.020 --> 21:16.740
One that has a happy ending.

21:17.920 --> 21:21.370
Makabe-kun! You're safe!

21:21.370 --> 21:22.400
Yeah.

21:22.400 --> 21:25.380
We were so worried!

21:25.790 --> 21:27.340
Where's Aki-sama?

21:28.690 --> 21:29.800
She's...

21:30.550 --> 21:31.810
